   "body": "You can definitely go there if you feel like it, it's a more kitey/rng game style, you just don't have the standarndized bomba capability, you split the dmg between Sunrise and Sunset. The build that i posted is more Sunrise orriented. Basically i only use Sunset to stack the 2nd go.",
